('16','1604F','S5',NULL,'Analog draft (unsourced)','7.4','2018-01-01',NULL,'draft','analog','{TIN}{BRANCH}{MMDDYYYY}1604F.DAT',',','CRLF','1','Windows-1252','0','bir_upper','Annex A/B of RMC 25-2024 lists these schedules but the PDF is image-only. Header mirrors the validated H1604C shape; detail mirrors QAP. Replace from Annex A before approval.','Research pending. Files are always labelled UNVALIDATED DRAFT.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 07:32:53','2026-10-17 07:32:53'),
('17','1604F','S6',NULL,'Analog draft (unsourced)','7.4','2018-01-01',NULL,'draft','analog','{TIN}{BRANCH}{MMDDYYYY}1604F.DAT',',','CRLF','1','Windows-1252','0','bir_upper','Annex A/B of RMC 25-2024 lists these schedules but the PDF is image-only. Header mirrors the validated H1604C shape; detail mirrors QAP. Replace from Annex A before approval.','Research pending. Files are always labelled UNVALIDATED DRAFT.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 07:32:53','2026-10-17 07:32:53'),
('18','SAWT','S1',NULL,'Alphalist v7.x SAWT','7.4','2018-01-01',NULL,'pending_verification','low','{TIN}{BRANCH}{MM}{YYYY}{SAWT_FORM}.DAT',',','CRLF','1','Windows-1252','0','bir_upper','Single secondary generator (github.com/AlmyrCPA/Haki-Bookkeeping-System), which notes this quoted shape for 1701/1701Q. No source found for 1700, 1702, 2550M/Q, 2551Q or 2553.','Used for every attached return except where a variant layout exists.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 07:32:53','2026-10-17 07:32:53'),
('19','SAWT','S1','1702Q','Alphalist v7.x SAWT (1702Q shape)','7.4','2018-01-01',NULL,'pending_verification','low','{TIN}{BRANCH}{MM}{YYYY}{SAWT_FORM}.DAT',',','CRLF','1','Windows-1252','0','bir_upper','Single secondary generator that describes this 1702Q shape as confirmed against validated files: names unquoted, amounts not padded, 5 trailing empty header fields and 8 trailing empty control fields. Unverified here.','Applied automatically when the attached return is 1702Q.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 07:32:53','2026-10-17 07:32:53'),
('20','SRS','S1',NULL,'Consolidation CSV (unsourced)',NULL,'2008-01-01',NULL,'draft','analog','{TIN}{BRANCH}SRS{SEM}{YYYY}.csv',',','CRLF','1','Windows-1252','1','bir_upper','SRS was required by RR 14-2008 (format under RMC 5-2009). A secondary source reports that RMC 122-2019 terminated SRS submission. Confirm current applicability before use; the official column layout was not obtainable.','Six-month consolidation of supplier purchases subject to the selected ATCs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 07:32:53','2026-10-17 07:32:53');
